  These are gaps in this exposition, not findings of a contradiction in the
  Lean source. The independent scope review found no concrete vacuity within
  its bounded inspection. The pinned build/axiom evidence is inherited from
  <hlink|source/build.md|../../../source/build.tm>, with its
  prebuilt-artifact limitation; it is not an audit of this English argument.

